<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Following the voice of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's dad</STYLE>, we came to the Arata settlement to attend the thirteenth-year memorial service. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And from <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, we heard about the curse-killings and <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
The reason I came here―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who the culprit behind the curse-killings is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And as a result...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<BR>
A pointless battle with no end in sight was about to begin.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This synopsis makes no sense at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... this is reality...<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, come on, what'll you do!? How do you plan to beat us, one against two!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE> was consoling <STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> were silently sipping their drinks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I was trying to enjoy the Arata food in silence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Nobody's even watching!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Since the </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">hunter girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> has challenged us, whoever goes out to the mountains now and brings back the bigger game wins!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> heard that, her face darkened even more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After being made to walk mountain trails all day, now a hunt in the mountains...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>, you're allowed to say no!<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yesss! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, let's win for sure!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Oh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Yeah, sure..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She seemed to have lost even the energy to think.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"All right! The time limit is one hour! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Okay then, begin!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE> left the living room still dressed as <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ぐったり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Uuu... </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> sank down where she was and hung her head.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, you shouldn't push yourself, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> seems all fired up... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">While I'm at it, I'll have </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> show me around and gather material for my deductions..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would be useful, but surely there was some other way...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! If we don't hurry, we'll lose! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　This time of year, there should be bears just up from hibernation and hungry, so let's go where the bears are!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"B... bear hunting...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> looked around as if begging for help.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
