{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's fine! Nobody cares...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uugh... I just want to stay young forever for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That embarrassing pose... if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> saw it, I could never attend the thirteenth-year memorial service..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's not true! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> understands the situation too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uugh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This mother and daughter were useless.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, good luck!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Bears are good, but snakes are good too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This father and daughter were drunk and useless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone's hopeless! And I'm no use...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ぐったり.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, it's fine if you lose. Just do a little and come back..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then I'd make </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> lose face... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">If I'm doing it, it's all-out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's already given it everything she's got...<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Want me to come with you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No... In case my phone goes out of range, please stand by here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>...! My cute junior...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you're that determined, I'll do what I can do!<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, let's go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With heavy steps, <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> left the living room with <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
That said, what I could do in this situation was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right! I was going to have <STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE> drive me to where the cherry trees are.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Can <STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE>... even move...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Uugh...! It's no good! I can't face </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> like this! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> said he loved me because we were two of a kind and understood each other...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Uugh... uugh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, get a grip...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was in no way a mood where I could ask her to drive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I couldn't have <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> drive drunk...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
That's it! Could I ask Shirozaki-san?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But he'd told me he didn't want anything to do with the precognition...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'll just try asking...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
