<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s house?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
